TABLE	function pointer	Kani
Parse	function pointer	Kani
Read	function pointer	Kani
# The C program's `environ` memory: no tool checks the caller's pointers; their validity is assumed.
read_slot	raw pointer from C caller	none (assumption)
byte_at	raw pointer from C caller	none (assumption)
bytes_at	raw pointer from C caller	none (assumption)
environ_array	raw pointer from C caller	none (assumption)
# Termination of the `environ` walk: the C program ends the array with a null pointer.
env_var	C-program contract	none (assumption)
# `CStr` literals, which Verus does not take: Verus sees each only as a
# value of its type (the whole contract). The const asserts pin the
# spelling of each name in every build.
THP_NAMES	core library	Kani	discharged (const assert: `THP_NAMES` in src/config.rs)	contract 2041706674, body none
PERCPU_ARENA_NAMES	core library	Kani	discharged (const assert: `PERCPU_ARENA_NAMES` in src/config.rs)	contract 2651964696, body none
# Built from `TABLE`, which holds function pointers; claimed only as a value of its type.
KEYS	function pointer	Kani	discharged (Kani: config::kani_config::keys_are_the_table_names)	contract 208287259, body none
# Checked by the Kani harnesses the status names (verus/README.md, "Kani").
Config::set_listed	function pointer	Kani	discharged (Kani: config::kani_config::set_listed_contract)	contract 1746912615, body 2364960765
# `get_contract` stubs `Thp::name` and `PercpuArena::name`, verified code
# (inside `verus!`), whose tables `THP_NAMES` and `PERCPU_ARENA_NAMES` the
# const asserts check; it runs the rest of `get`, the `TABLE` readers included.
Config::get	function pointer	Kani	discharged (Kani: config::kani_config::get_contract)	contract 2444094337, body 4260931877
# Inline assembly checked with Isla (verus/ISLA.md): run.sh checks
# each against the contract verus/isla/seams.md quotes.
malloc_conf_addr	inline asm	Islaris/Isla	discharged (Isla: verus/isla/seams.md)	contract 235445132, body 2594729634
je_malloc_conf_addr	inline asm	Islaris/Isla	discharged (Isla: verus/isla/seams.md)	contract 3550187510, body 2728554437
